WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:05.313 line:15%
Really high winds now here in a typhoon in Tokyo!

2
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:10.490 line:15%
I shouldn't be outside, but I am, because--

3
00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:11.553 line:15%
I look heroic.

4
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.803 line:15%
These are typhoon winds, I tell ya!

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.590
Oh, here comes someone, hello.

6
00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:18.560
Act more dramatic.

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.770
You're totally undercutting what I'm doing.

8
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.143
I'm going like this.

9
00:00:23.952 --> 00:00:25.710
No, and you're just walking with coffee?

10
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.054
On a Starbucks run?

11
00:00:27.054 --> 00:00:27.930
It's not Starbucks.

12
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.430
Get outta my shot!

13
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.590
Here comes a very brave young investment banker.

14
00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.040
Get inside, you'll be killed.

15
00:00:37.452 --> 00:00:39.011
Oh, thank you, thank you very much.

16
00:00:39.011 --> 00:00:40.340
You're good man.

17
00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.680
You went out of your way to make a snide comment.

18
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.097
Okay, release that water bottle so it looks dramatic!

19
00:00:49.311 --> 00:00:50.430
That's it?

20
00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.770 line:15%
This is Conan O'Brien for Channel Four News,

21
00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:54.130 line:15%
saying we used to be Channel Seven News,

22
00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.390 line:15%
one day, day we'll be Channel Two News.

23
00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.420 line:15%
Back to you CNN.

24
00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:58.920 line:15%
This has been TBS.

